        <mxCell id="n22" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e4c5f7;fontColor=#303238;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;opacity=100;" value="&lt;b&gt;Default&lt;/b&gt;: docker-compose.leds.yaml, one dr_leds per instance (two simulated LEDs, no hardware).&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;FSP / SO → plugin&lt;/b&gt;: GET / (describe) · POST /start · /stop · /events · /control (FSP: Operates on claimed objRefs) · GET /attached.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;HMI → BFF → instance&lt;/b&gt;: /api/plugins (list, add, edit, reload, remove) and /api/plugins/{name}/{path} → the plugin&#39;s own routes. Configuration: config/plugin-configuration/ (PLUGINS_FILE), PLUGIN_ALLOWED_SOURCES.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="440" x="860" y="810" as="geometry" />
